{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/05.-koleksi-tata-letak-(menu,-message,-dan-table)","title":"05. Koleksi Tata Letak (Menu, Message, dan Table)","slug":"05. koleksi tata letak (menu, message, dan table)","relativePath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI/05. Koleksi Tata Letak (Menu, Message, dan Table).md","folder":"Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI","frontmatter":{"tags":[],"aliases":[]},"tags":["programming"],"aliases":[],"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"1. Bilah Navigasi Menu (`ui menu`)","id":"1-bilah-navigasi-menu-ui-menu"},{"depth":3,"text":"A. Navigasi Tunjuk Modern (`secondary pointing menu`)","id":"a-navigasi-tunjuk-modern-secondary-pointing-menu"},{"depth":3,"text":"B. Menu Bilah Samping Vertikal (`vertical menu`)","id":"b-menu-bilah-samping-vertikal-vertical-menu"},{"depth":3,"text":"C. Menu Tab Arsip (`tabular menu`)","id":"c-menu-tab-arsip-tabular-menu"},{"depth":2,"text":"2. Kotak Pesan dan Peringatan (`ui message`)","id":"2-kotak-pesan-dan-peringatan-ui-message"},{"depth":2,"text":"3. Tabel Penyajian Data (`ui table`)","id":"3-tabel-penyajian-data-ui-table"}],"content":"#programming \n\nKategori **Collections** dalam Semantic UI merupakan kelompok komponen yang menyusun struktur tata letak informasi utama, seperti bilah navigasi, kotak pengumuman status, dan penyajian data tabular.\n\n## 1. Bilah Navigasi Menu (`ui menu`)\n\nKomponen menu Semantic UI sangat serbaguna dan dapat beradaptasi menjadi berbagai varian tata letak:\n\n### A. Navigasi Tunjuk Modern (`secondary pointing menu`)\nGaya menu minimalis dengan garis penunjuk aktif di bawah item:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"ui secondary pointing menu\">\n  <a class=\"active item\">Dasbor Utama</a>\n  <a class=\"item\">Pesan Masuk</a>\n  <a class=\"item\">Laporan Analitik</a>\n  <div class=\"right menu\">\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"ui transparent icon input\">\n        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Cari...\">\n        <i class=\"search link icon\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <a class=\"ui item\">Keluar Sesi</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### B. Menu Bilah Samping Vertikal (`vertical menu`)\nCocok untuk navigasi sidebar admin atau filter katalog:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"ui vertical menu\">\n  <a class=\"active teal item\">\n    Pesan Masuk\n    <div class=\"ui teal left pointing label\">12</div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"item\">\n    Pemberitahuan\n    <div class=\"ui label\">3</div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"item\">\n    Arsip Berkas\n    <div class=\"ui label\">51</div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n```\n\n### C. Menu Tab Arsip (`tabular menu`)\nDigunakan berdampingan dengan komponen `ui tab` untuk beralih antar halaman konten:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"ui top attached tabular menu\">\n  <a class=\"active item\" data-tab=\"pertama\">Profil</a>\n  <a class=\"item\" data-tab=\"kedua\">Keamanan</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ui bottom attached active tab segment\" data-tab=\"pertama\">\n  Konten Profil Pengguna\n</div>\n<div class=\"ui bottom attached tab segment\" data-tab=\"kedua\">\n  Konten Pengaturan Kata Sandi\n</div>\n```\n\n## 2. Kotak Pesan dan Peringatan (`ui message`)\n\nClass `ui message` digunakan untuk memberikan umpan balik langsung kepada pengguna:\n\n```html\n<!-- Pesan Informasi Berikon -->\n<div class=\"ui icon info message\">\n  <i class=\"info circle icon\"></i>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"header\">Pembaruan Sistem Dijadwalkan</div>\n    <p>Pemeliharaan rutin server akan dilaksanakan pada hari Minggu pukul 02.00 WIB.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Pesan Kesalahan dengan Tombol Tutup -->\n<div class=\"ui negative message\">\n  <i class=\"close icon\"></i>\n  <div class=\"header\">Gagal Menyimpan Data</div>\n  <p>Format alamat surel yang Anda masukkan tidak valid.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\nUntuk mengaktifkan fungsi penutup pesan silang:\n```javascript\n$('.message .close').on('click', function() {\n  $(this).closest('.message').transition('fade');\n});\n```\n\n## 3. Tabel Penyajian Data (`ui table`)\n\nTabel Semantic UI dirancang dengan standar tipografi yang bersih dan beragam modifier struktural:\n\n- **`celled table`**: Menampilkan garis pemisah antar kolom secara tegas.\n- **`striped table`**: Memberikan warna selang-seling pada baris tabel (zebra).\n- **`selectable table`**: Memberikan efek sorotan warna saat baris dilewati kursor mouse.\n- **`compact table`**: Merapatkan ruang vertikal sel untuk menampilkan data dalam jumlah padat.\n\n```html\n<table class=\"ui celled striped selectable table\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>No</th>\n      <th>Nama Karyawan</th>\n      <th>Departemen</th>\n      <th>Status Kerja</th>\n      <th>Aksi</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>Aryanda Pratama</td>\n      <td>Engineering</td>\n      <td><span class=\"ui green label\">Tetap</span></td>\n      <td><button class=\"ui mini blue button\">Rincian</button></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>Siti Rahma</td>\n      <td>Product Design</td>\n      <td><span class=\"ui orange label\">Kontrak</span></td>\n      <td><button class=\"ui mini blue button\">Rincian</button></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n```\n\n---\nLanjutkan pembelajaran ke pembuatan form dan validasi: [06. Formulir dan Validasi Otomatis](06.%20Formulir%20dan%20Validasi%20Otomatis.md).\n","excerpt":"#programming","readingTime":3,"updated":null,"contentHash":"sha256:e449db763cb518e8d66e42eb4de0b06fd6ca69a3c30d2a80afdfd18cf72d9663","outputPath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI/05. Koleksi Tata Letak (Menu, Message, dan Table)","breadcrumb":["Pemrograman","CSS","Semantic UI"],"links":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/06.-formulir-dan-validasi-otomatis","title":"06. Formulir dan Validasi Otomatis","href":"/docs/pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/06.-formulir-dan-validasi-otomatis"}],"backlinks":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/04.-elemen-antarmuka-esensial-(button,-header,-segment,-dan-icon)","title":"04. Elemen Antarmuka Esensial (Button, Header, Segment, dan Icon)"},{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/05_semantic-ui","title":"05_Semantic UI"}],"brokenLinks":[],"html":"<p>Kategori <strong>Collections</strong> dalam Semantic UI merupakan kelompok komponen yang menyusun struktur tata letak informasi utama, seperti bilah navigasi, kotak pengumuman status, dan penyajian data tabular.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-bilah-navigasi-menu-ui-menu\">1. Bilah Navigasi Menu (<code>ui menu</code>)</h2>\n<p>Komponen menu Semantic UI sangat serbaguna dan dapat beradaptasi menjadi berbagai varian tata letak:</p>\n<h3 id=\"a-navigasi-tunjuk-modern-secondary-pointing-menu\">A. Navigasi Tunjuk Modern (<code>secondary pointing menu</code>)</h3>\n<p>Gaya menu minimalis dengan garis penunjuk aktif di bawah item:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui secondary pointing menu\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"active item\"</span>></span>Dasbor Utama<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"item\"</span>></span>Pesan Masuk<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"item\"</span>></span>Laporan Analitik<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"right menu\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"item\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui transparent icon input\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Cari...\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"search link icon\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui item\"</span>></span>Keluar Sesi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"b-menu-bilah-samping-vertikal-vertical-menu\">B. Menu Bilah Samping Vertikal (<code>vertical menu</code>)</h3>\n<p>Cocok untuk navigasi sidebar admin atau filter katalog:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui vertical menu\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"active teal item\"</span>></span>\n    Pesan Masuk\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui teal left pointing label\"</span>></span>12<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"item\"</span>></span>\n    Pemberitahuan\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui label\"</span>></span>3<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"item\"</span>></span>\n    Arsip Berkas\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui label\"</span>></span>51<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"c-menu-tab-arsip-tabular-menu\">C. Menu Tab Arsip (<code>tabular menu</code>)</h3>\n<p>Digunakan berdampingan dengan komponen <code>ui tab</code> untuk beralih antar halaman konten:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui top attached tabular menu\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"active item\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-tab</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"pertama\"</span>></span>Profil<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"item\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-tab</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"kedua\"</span>></span>Keamanan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui bottom attached active tab segment\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-tab</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"pertama\"</span>></span>\n  Konten Profil Pengguna\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui bottom attached tab segment\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-tab</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"kedua\"</span>></span>\n  Konten Pengaturan Kata Sandi\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"2-kotak-pesan-dan-peringatan-ui-message\">2. Kotak Pesan dan Peringatan (<code>ui message</code>)</h2>\n<p>Class <code>ui message</code> digunakan untuk memberikan umpan balik langsung kepada pengguna:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Pesan Informasi Berikon --></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui icon info message\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"info circle icon\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"content\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"header\"</span>></span>Pembaruan Sistem Dijadwalkan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>></span>Pemeliharaan rutin server akan dilaksanakan pada hari Minggu pukul 02.00 WIB.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Pesan Kesalahan dengan Tombol Tutup --></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui negative message\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"close icon\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"header\"</span>></span>Gagal Menyimpan Data<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>></span>Format alamat surel yang Anda masukkan tidak valid.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>Untuk mengaktifkan fungsi penutup pesan silang:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-javascript\">$(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'.message .close'</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">on</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'click'</span>, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  $(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">closest</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'.message'</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">transition</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'fade'</span>);\n});\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"3-tabel-penyajian-data-ui-table\">3. Tabel Penyajian Data (<code>ui table</code>)</h2>\n<p>Tabel Semantic UI dirancang dengan standar tipografi yang bersih dan beragam modifier struktural:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>celled table</code></strong>: Menampilkan garis pemisah antar kolom secara tegas.</li>\n<li><strong><code>striped table</code></strong>: Memberikan warna selang-seling pada baris tabel (zebra).</li>\n<li><strong><code>selectable table</code></strong>: Memberikan efek sorotan warna saat baris dilewati kursor mouse.</li>\n<li><strong><code>compact table</code></strong>: Merapatkan ruang vertikal sel untuk menampilkan data dalam jumlah padat.</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">table</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui celled striped selectable table\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">thead</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>No<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>Nama Karyawan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>Departemen<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>Status Kerja<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>Aksi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">thead</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tbody</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>Aryanda Pratama<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>Engineering<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui green label\"</span>></span>Tetap<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui mini blue button\"</span>></span>Rincian<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>2<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>Siti Rahma<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>Product Design<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui orange label\"</span>></span>Kontrak<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui mini blue button\"</span>></span>Rincian<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tbody</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">table</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p>Lanjutkan pembelajaran ke pembuatan form dan validasi: <a href=\"/docs/pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/06.-formulir-dan-validasi-otomatis\">06. Formulir dan Validasi Otomatis</a>.</p>","previous":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/05_semantic-ui","next":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/06.-formulir-dan-validasi-otomatis"}